<title>UK: Hazlewood Foods up after H1 results. [CORRECTED 11:03 GMT]</title>
<headline>Hazlewood Foods up after H1 results. [CORRECTED 11:03 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK food processing and fresh meats group Hazlewood Foods Plc rose on Tuesday after first-half results showed steady pre-tax profits of 16.1 million stg (corrects figure).</p>
<p>At 0845 GMT, Hazlewood shares were up 8-1/2p at 106p.</p>
<p>Hazlewood was optimistic about its second half performance and said strong performances in three divisions had offset the impact of BSE, or &quot;mad cow&quot; disease, in the first half.</p>
<p>--Brian Killen, London newsroom 44 171 542 7972</p>
